  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c59921a22062079419e0bffed4cfa04b, type: 3}
  m_Name: K-02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: K-02
  readyForPlay: 1
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: afet_senaryolari_kaynak_12.md. Vatanda\u015F s\xF6zleri kaynaktan aynen al\u0131nm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
  opening:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: 912 Acil \xC7a\u011Fr\u0131 Merkezi, buyrun?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: \u0130yi g\xFCnler operat\xF6r han\u0131m. Ben Kerem... Az \xF6nce bir sars\u0131nt\u0131 ya\u015Fad\u0131k buralarda. Ailece sakin kald\u0131k, sallant\u0131da kanepenin yan\u0131na \xC7\xD6K-KAPAN-TUTUN yapt\u0131k."
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Harika Kerem Bey, ge\xE7mi\u015F olsun. Herhangi bir hasar veya yaralanma var m\u0131?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Kerem: \xC7ok \u015F\xFCk\xFCr yok. Sars\u0131nt\u0131 bitti, vanalar\u0131 kapatt\u0131k. Kap\u0131 yan\u0131ndaki acil durum \xE7antam\u0131z\u0131 ald\u0131k; i\xE7inde suyumuz, fenerimiz, d\xFCd\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFCz ve evraklar\u0131m\u0131z var. Toplanma alan\u0131na \xE7\u0131k\u0131yoruz. Do\u011Fru mu yap\u0131yoruz?"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Kerem: Operat\xF6r\xFCm, afet \xE7antam\u0131z\u0131 al\u0131p toplanma alan\u0131na ge\xE7i\u015Fimizi onayl\u0131yor musunuz?"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Kesinlikle tebrik ederiz! \xD6rnek bir afet bilinci, toplanma alan\u0131na ge\xE7in."
  choiceB: "Hay\u0131r, \xE7anta gereksiz bir a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k, sars\u0131nt\u0131 bittiyse evinizde bekleyin."
  correctChoiceIsB: 0
  resourceA: 2
  resourceB: 2
  dispatchA: 0
  dispatchB: 1
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Kerem Bey, sizi ve ailenizi tebrik ederim. Harika bir bilin\xE7 sergilemi\u015Fsiniz. \xC7antan\u0131z\u0131 al\u0131p g\xFCvenli toplanma alan\u0131na ge\xE7in."
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Kerem: \xC7ok te\u015Fekk\xFCr ederiz operat\xF6r\xFCm, kolay gelsin sizlere!"
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Kerem: Nas\u0131l yani? Afet \xE7antas\u0131n\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131p eve mi d\xF6nelim? Ama AFAD tatbikatlar\u0131nda b\xF6yle \xF6\u011Fretmi\u015Flerdi... Kafam\u0131z kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131..."
    fromOperator: 0
